  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the Young Urban Women and Valuing Women&#x2019;s Work initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ActionAid&#x2019;s Young Urban Women and Valuing Women&#x2019;s Work initiatives work to challenge mainstream economic policies, narratives, and institutions that fail to recognize and value women&#x2019;s paid and unpaid work and thus undermine their access to decent work in Ghana, Malawi, and Kenya, as well as in regional African and global spaces.</narrative>
  </description>
